 "_design": "Overlord jab 2 v3 (ANIM-JAB-5, 2026-11-12) from cards/overlord/jab/overlord_jab_v3_pose_plan.md: villain claw slap with a step forward, then he looks at his hand. f0 = jab 1 f12. f3 weight onto the right foot, f6 windup (left knee up, chest 55 right, claw high behind the head), f8 left foot lands heel first, f9 contact in a deep lunge with the arm on a descending diagonal, f13 rake to low-left at the lowest point, f20 observe (forearm vertical in front of the face) held to the FAF f26; tremor f27-37 lives in the Manuale layer; clench f38-41, head up first, right foot steps up to the idle stance f41-47, idle f52 30 cm ahead of the start.",
 "_changes": "v3: new card, nothing reused from v2 (rejected in game as static). Adds the 30 cm step as root motion.",
 "_tremor": "Not in the card: the hand tremor f27-37 is keyed on hand_r_fk_ctrl Rotation in the additive 'Manuale' section of LS_OverlordJab2V3_Build (see v2 _tremor), zero at f26 and f38.",
 "_root_motion": "StepForwardCm=30 as root motion: root_ctrl Location Y += the ROOT table through `edits` (0 at f0-3, 3 at f6, 8 at f7, 17 at f8, 30 from f9 to the end). Author poses are ROOT-relative: the right foot is planted in the world until f41, so its root-space Y is (stomp spot - root) on exactly the same keys and profiles; the left foot lands 30 cm ahead in the world at f8 (= its idle root-space spot from f9). Assumes root_ctrl's local Y is component +Y and that body/feet controls are children of root_ctrl (UNTESTED in Unreal).",
